---
title: Step 4 — User creates a booking + create conditions
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant P as protect + authorize
    participant C as controllers/bookings
    participant H as Hotel model
    participant B as Booking model

    U->>P: POST /hotels/:hotelId/bookings {checkIn, checkOut}
    alt not logged in
        P-->>U: 401 Not authorized
    end
    P->>C: addBooking()
    C->>C: parseStay(): 1–3 nights, check-in not in the past
    alt 0 or more than 3 nights, or check-in in the past
        C-->>U: 400 Bad Request
    end
    Note over C,B: MongoDB transaction
    C->>H: lock hotel document
    alt hotel not found
        C-->>U: 404 No hotel with this id
    end
    C->>B: count overlapping bookings
    alt no rooms left
        C-->>U: 409 No rooms available
    end
    C->>B: create({checkIn, checkOut, user, hotel})
    C-->>U: 201 Created {booking}
